            "updated_at": "2026-10-04T22:49:12.000000Z"
        },
        {
            "id": 11825,
            "question_id": 23745,
            "provider": "chatgpt",
            "locale": "uk",
            "hint": "Лексична основа: question — ставити під сумнів. Не прирівнюй завершений результат або стан до тривалого процесу. Обидві частини мають зберегти свої значення.",
            "created_at": "2026-10-04T22:49:12.000000Z",
            "updated_at": "2026-10-04T22:49:12.000000Z"
        },
        {
            "id": 11826,
            "question_id": 23745,
            "provider": "compose_prompt",
            "locale": "en",
            "hint": "Use the past perfect continuous for the earlier process. Start with the main-clause subject; do not move time or reason phrases to the front. Distinguish prior acceptance of a principle from continued questioning of its consequences.",
            "created_at": "2026-10-04T22:49:12.000000Z",
            "updated_at": "2026-10-04T22:49:12.000000Z"
        },
        {
            "id": 11827,
            "question_id": 23745,
            "provider": "chatgpt",
            "locale": "en",
            "hint": "Lexical verb: question. Keep the distinction between a completed result or state and an ongoing process in the two clauses.",
            "created_at": "2026-10-04T22:49:12.000000Z",
            "updated_at": "2026-10-04T22:49:12.000000Z"
        },
        {
            "id": 11828,
            "question_id": 23745,
            "provider": "compose_prompt",
            "locale": "pl",
            "hint": "Użyj Past Perfect Continuous dla wcześniejszego procesu. Zacznij od podmiotu zdania głównego; nie przenoś wyrażeń czasu ani przyczyny na początek. Zaakceptowałem tę zasadę, ale przez cały ten czas kwestionowałem jej praktyczne konsekwencje.",
            "created_at": "2026-10-04T22:49:12.000000Z",
            "updated_at": "2026-10-04T22:49:12.000000Z"
        },
